DECODE_THROUGHPUT_STAGE name=stream_path_total_current status=measured cycles_per_mb=259.391 note=Includes ioctl byte feed, Annex-B scanner/SPS/PPS/slice parse, current intra reconstruction path, and diagnostic frame emission in the existing full-frame RTL simulation.
